{"name": "Knuckle Jet", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25ba Jet-fueled knuckle acrobatics!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scientifically inaccurate flight action that rewards high-speed momentum and precision. Feel free to completely ignore G-force in the name of awesomeness, and keep smashing, crashing and crushing to stay in the flow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"256\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199470/extras/4df01d43a78eca47f20797ecd14eeba8.poster.avif?t=1787754138\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199470/extras/4df01d43a78eca47f20797ecd14eeba8.webm?t=1787754138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25ba Non-stop arcade action!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tons of standalone levels  packed to bursting with  mechanical foes to punch. Anastasia stands at the ready to give them all a knuckle (jet) sandwich. Utilize your environment, find hidden collectibles, and chase perfection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"256\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199470/extras/db6dc28b3f4c82d4bdccc23cbdb9ebd2.poster.avif?t=1787754138\" width=\"660\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199470/extras/db6dc28b3f4c82d4bdccc23cbdb9ebd2.webm?t=1787754138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199470/extras/db6dc28b3f4c82d4bdccc23cbdb9ebd2.mp4?t=1787754138\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25ba Hoard equipment for the challenges ahead!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect and upgrade a large array of gear that offers drastic gameplay changes. Ignore all fashion sense and pick item combinations that suit your playstyle, specialize in optimized builds for each challenge, or dress to impress with  the most stylish sets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"256\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199470/extras/2e9d8e4f7efd74f75f8ea484af1d8e3f.poster.avif?t=1787754138\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199470/extras/2e9d8e4f7efd74f75f8ea484af1d8e3f.webm?t=1787754138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199470/extras/2e9d8e4f7efd74f75f8ea484af1d8e3f.mp4?t=1787754138\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25ba A rogues gallery of despicable villains!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From high-rise clockwork cities to soot black forests, each biome in Motorland is under the grip of the power-hungry industrialist Tychoon and his band of business associates. They've kidnapped an entire orphanage and put the little ragamuffins to work amongst the crushing pistons and spinning cogs of their robotic death machines. It's up to Anastasia to crush this cadre of conniving crooks before facing the ultimate foe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"256\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199470/extras/5b4fe7e30aba52126efe67b6d605dd2a.poster.avif?t=1787754138\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199470/extras/5b4fe7e30aba52126efe67b6d605dd2a.webm?t=1787754138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199470/extras/5b4fe7e30aba52126efe67b6d605dd2a.mp4?t=1787754138\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25ba Drop into battle together with a friend!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is nice to have friends. It's even better when they can join you in battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"256\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199470/extras/276b1f8d66de97f9066f0ae6538d8c26.poster.avif?t=1787754138\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199470/extras/276b1f8d66de97f9066f0ae6538d8c26.webm?t=1787754138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199470/extras/276b1f8d66de97f9066f0ae6538d8c26.mp4?t=1787754138\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "What's this? An off-the-wall, riveting jetpunk nose-breaking ricochet action platformer, lovingly crafted by the oddballs behind the Teslagrad series!", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199470/40c7ad4a5734b5a1515140893c8c4d8aa8e0ab21/header.jpg?t=1787754138", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Precision Platformer", "Side Scroller", "2D Platformer", "Platformer", "Action RPG", "Arcade"], "developers": "Rain Games", "publishers": "Rain Games", "release_date": "Q3 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3199470", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "12 May 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/Wo8Fz7GxMIU", "first_seen": 1778536800.0, "review_rank": 648}